<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fifth Third upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fifth Third upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co said it upgraded the rating on Fifth Third Bancorp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/4 to 60-3/4.</p>
</text>
